WEBVTT

00:09:58.483 --> 00:10:02.919
Someone described pretty well
our human condition in this noisy age.

00:10:02.943 --> 00:10:04.169
You know who?

00:10:04.609 --> 00:10:07.207
Shakespeare, 400 years ago.

00:10:07.231 --> 00:10:11.118
["(Life is) a tale told by an idiot, full
of sound and fury, signifying nothing."]

00:10:11.142 --> 00:10:13.862
This speaks to me.
Shakespeare is still very relevant, no?

00:10:13.886 --> 00:10:15.424
But the world has changed a bit.

00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:16.601
[Too long!]

00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:18.161
(Laughter)

00:10:18.185 --> 00:10:19.342
It's true.

00:10:19.366 --> 00:10:24.158
(Applause)

00:10:25.198 --> 00:10:29.217
You know, social media is both
a blessing and a curse for cartoons.

00:10:29.685 --> 00:10:33.803
This is the era of the image,
so they get shared, they get viral,